30","type":"SC TO-C","title":"Tender Offer/Acquisition Reports","url":"https://cdn.yahoofinance.com/prod/sec-filings/0000354950/000110465925063843/tm2519425d1_sctoc.htm"},{"d":"2025-06-25","type":"11-K","title":"Annual report of employee stock purchase","url":"https://cdn.yahoofinance.com/prod/sec-filings/0000354950/000035495025000187/hd_prx11kx12312024.htm"}],"wiki":{"en":{"t":"Home Depot","x":"The Home Depot, Inc. is an American multinational home improvement retail corporation which sells tools, construction products, building materials, appliances, and services including fuel and transportation rentals. Home Depot is the largest home improvement specialty retailer in the United States. In fiscal 2024, the company reported $159.5 billion in revenue and approximately 470,100 associates. The company is headquartered in Cobb County, Georgia, with an Atlanta mailing address.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Home_Depot"},"ru":{"t":"The Home Depot","x":"The Home Depot — американская торговая сеть, являющаяся крупнейшей в мире по продаже стройматериалов и инструментов для ремонта. Штаб-квартира компании находится в Атланте. Сеть компании насчитывает более 2300 магазинов в США, Канаде и Мексике. The Home Depot является одним из крупнейших ретейлеров в США.","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Home_Depot"}},"wiki_at":"2026-10-29T15:10:15.780765+00:00"}